-- The punishment the text states under one limb (the maximum and the minimum, as the text writes them).
-- COVERS[encoded]: s 272(2)(a); s 272(2)(a)(i); s 272(2)(a)(ii); s 272(2)(a.1); s 272(2)(a.2); s 272(2)(b)
-- src:5075 | (2) Every person who commits an offence under subsection (1) is guilty of an indictable offence and liable
-- src:5076 | (a) if a restricted firearm or prohibited firearm is used in the commission of the offence or if any firearm is used in the commission of the offence and the offence is committed for the benefit of, at the direction of, or in association with, a criminal organization, to imprisonment for a term not exceeding 14 years and to a minimum punishment of imprisonment for a term of
-- src:5077 | (i) in the case of a first offence, five years, and
-- src:5078 | (ii) in the case of a second or subsequent offence, seven years;
-- src:5079 | (a.1) in any other case where a firearm is used in the commission of the offence, to imprisonment for a term not exceeding 14 years and to a minimum punishment of imprisonment for a term of four years; and
-- src:5080 | (a.2) if the complainant is under the age of 16 years, to imprisonment for life and to a minimum punishment of imprisonment for a term of five years; and
-- src:5081 | (b) in any other case, to imprisonment for a term not exceeding fourteen years.
@ref Criminal Code s 272(2) (src:5075-5081)
GIVEN limb IS A `s 272(2) limb`
GIVETH A Punishment
`s 272(2) the punishment under the limb` MEANS
    CONSIDER limb
    WHEN `s 272(2)(a) a restricted or prohibited firearm, or a firearm for a criminal organization: first offence` THEN Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), (`imprisonment for a term of` `five years`), `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`   -- (a)(i): not exceeding 14 years, minimum five years for a first offence
    WHEN `s 272(2)(a) a restricted or prohibited firearm, or a firearm for a criminal organization: second or subsequent offence` THEN Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 7, 0, 0, FALSE)), `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`   -- (a)(ii): minimum seven years for a second or subsequent offence
    WHEN `s 272(2)(a.1) any other case where a firearm is used` THEN Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 4, 0, 0, FALSE)), `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`   -- (a.1): not exceeding 14 years, minimum four years
    WHEN `s 272(2)(a.2) the complainant is under the age of 16 years` THEN Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for life`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `five years`), `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`   -- (a.2): imprisonment for life, minimum five years
    WHEN `s 272(2)(b) any other case` THEN Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`   -- (b): not exceeding fourteen years

-- Which limbs apply. (a) is split into first and second-or-subsequent by the answer of subsection (3). NOTHING when an answer the limbs turn on is NOTHING.
-- COVERS[encoded]: s 272(2)
-- src:5075 | (2) Every person who commits an offence under subsection (1) is guilty of an indictable offence and liable
-- src:5076 | (a) if a restricted firearm or prohibited firearm is used in the commission of the offence or if any firearm is used in the commission of the offence and the offence is committed for the benefit of, at the direction of, or in association with, a criminal organization, to imprisonment for a term not exceeding 14 years and to a minimum punishment of imprisonment for a term of
-- src:5077 | (i) in the case of a first offence, five years, and
-- src:5078 | (ii) in the case of a second or subsequent offence, seven years;
-- src:5079 | (a.1) in any other case where a firearm is used in the commission of the offence, to imprisonment for a term not exceeding 14 years and to a minimum punishment of imprisonment for a term of four years; and
-- src:5080 | (a.2) if the complainant is under the age of 16 years, to imprisonment for life and to a minimum punishment of imprisonment for a term of five years; and
-- src:5081 | (b) in any other case, to imprisonment for a term not exceeding fourteen years.
@ref Criminal Code s 272(2) (src:5075-5081)
GIVEN facts IS A `s 272(2) facts`
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF `s 272(2) limb`)
`s 272(2) the limbs that apply` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF any (GIVEN a YIELD a EQUALS NOTHING) (LIST `s 272(2)(a) a restricted firearm or prohibited firearm is used, or a firearm is used for a criminal organization` facts, `s 272(2)(a.1) any other case where a firearm is used` facts, `s 272(2)(b) any other case` facts) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): a limb turns on an answer of s 2, s 84(1) or s 467.1(1) that is itself not covered
        IF `s 272(2)(a) a restricted firearm or prohibited firearm is used, or a firearm is used for a criminal organization` facts EQUALS JUST TRUE AND facts's `the offence is a second or subsequent offence, by subsection (3)` EQUALS NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the offence is a second or subsequent one is the answer of subsection (3), itself not covered
        OTHERWISE JUST (concat (LIST `the entries for limb (a)`, `the entries for limb (a.1)`, `the entries for limb (a.2)`, `the entries for limb (b)`))
    WHERE
        `the entries for limb (a)` MEANS
            IF `s 272(2)(a) a restricted firearm or prohibited firearm is used, or a firearm is used for a criminal organization` facts EQUALS JUST TRUE
            THEN (IF facts's `the offence is a second or subsequent offence, by subsection (3)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
                  THEN LIST `s 272(2)(a) a restricted or prohibited firearm, or a firearm for a criminal organization: second or subsequent offence`
                  ELSE LIST `s 272(2)(a) a restricted or prohibited firearm, or a firearm for a criminal organization: first offence`)
            ELSE EMPTY
        `the entries for limb (a.1)` MEANS
            IF `s 272(2)(a.1) any other case where a firearm is used` facts EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN LIST `s 272(2)(a.1) any other case where a firearm is used` ELSE EMPTY
        `the entries for limb (a.2)` MEANS
            IF `s 272(2)(a.2) the complainant is under the age of 16 years` facts THEN LIST `s 272(2)(a.2) the complainant is under the age of 16 years` ELSE EMPTY
        `the entries for limb (b)` MEANS
            IF `s 272(2)(b) any other case` facts EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN LIST `s 272(2)(b) any other case` ELSE EMPTY

