    OR charge's `section` EQUALS 155 OR charge's `section` EQUALS 160 OR charge's `section` EQUALS 170 OR charge's `section` EQUALS 171
    OR charge's `section` EQUALS 172 OR charge's `section` EQUALS 173 OR charge's `section` EQUALS 271 OR charge's `section` EQUALS 272
    OR charge's `section` EQUALS 273 OR charge's `section` EQUALS 286.1 OR charge's `section` EQUALS 286.2 OR charge's `section` EQUALS 286.3

